decided that she would rather go on the stage than do anything else.

she spent days in campaspe’s motor, and out of it in smart shops,
outfitting herself at campaspe’s expense. she was aware of her beauty
and not without taste, it was discovered, when it came to adorning
it, withal this taste was somewhat bizarre. she had begun by assuming
such ready-made dresses as could be easily summoned from the backs of
