it approaches lightly, nimbly, and with courtesy. it is amiable.
it does not produce sweat. what is good is easy; everything divine
runs with light feet: the first proposition of my Æsthetics.... how
delightful the scene in kaiser’s play in which the german grandmother
dies because her son leaves the house before eating his dinner! it
had never happened before. what a comment on german character! and
ten times as powerful as if the scene had been presented as something
