to the theatre! cupid was very much astonished.

certainly. why not?

but you usually.... i have an engagement, but i’ll break it. whenever
you want me, you know i’m here.

why was every one so pathetic today? she remembered that paul had once
asked her why she had married, and she had answered that everybody
should marry at least once, and he had insisted, but why cupid? and she
